

Note that a big endian machine will create data files with
big endian order : 

enceladus$ ./timedump 
DBUG : filename len = 14
     : filename     = "20220326170727"
DBUG :  8 byte double  c_r           num_written = 1
     :  8 byte double  c_j           num_written = 1
     :  4 byte integer bail_out      num_written = 1
     :  4 byte integer magnify       num_written = 1
     :  4 byte integer num_elements  num_written = 1
enceladus$ 
enceladus$ dn
20220326170729

enceladus$ od -Ax -t x1 -v  20220326170727
000000 3f d9 95 85 0d 50 00 00 3f ca 45 b0 de d0 00 00
000010 00 00 80 00 10 00 00 00 01 00 00 00
00001c
enceladus$ 


